  "prefLabel": "Ins 2701.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2701.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to establish standards for determining whether a carrier’s provider network is sufficient in numbers, types, and geographic location of providers to ensure that covered persons will have access to health care services without unreasonable delay.\n\nSource. #7701, eff 8-1-02; ss by #9722, eff 8-1-10; ss by #12565, eff 8-1-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins2700.html"
